---
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
---
<Specimen title="Corner radii" code={'--radius-sm   /* inputs, small chips */\n--radius      /* code, small tiles */\n--radius-lg   /* tiles */\n--radius-xl   /* capstone tiles, CTA band */\n999px         /* buttons, pills, badges */'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Soft, generous corners. Interactive pills are fully rounded; panels get larger radii as they get larger.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="radii">
        <div class="radius r-sm"><code>sm</code></div>
        <div class="radius r-md"><code>default</code></div>
        <div class="radius r-lg"><code>lg</code></div>
        <div class="radius r-xl"><code>xl</code></div>
        <div class="radius r-pill"><code>pill</code></div>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Squircles" code={'@supports (corner-shape: squircle) {\n  * { corner-shape: squircle; }\n  .button, .pill, .badge, .round, … { corner-shape: round; }\n}'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>Where the browser supports <code>corner-shape</code>, rounded corners become squircles: continuous superellipse curves, like an app icon, instead of circular arcs. Other browsers keep ordinary rounded corners, so nothing breaks.</p>
        <p>A squircle looks tighter than a circular corner of the same radius, so the radius tokens grow when squircles are on (sm 1rem, default 1.5rem, lg 2.375rem, xl 3rem; otherwise 0.75, 1.125, 1.75 and 2.25rem). Capsules and circles (buttons, pills, badges, round icon buttons) keep circular ends; add <code>.round</code> to opt any other element out.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <div class="squircle-compare">
        <figure><div class="sq-sample sq-round"></div><figcaption><code>corner-shape: round</code></figcaption></figure>
        <figure><div class="sq-sample"></div><figcaption><code>corner-shape: squircle</code> (where supported)</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Elevation" surface="alt" code={'box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile);        /* resting tile */\nbox-shadow: var(--shadow-tile-hover);  /* lifted on hover */\nbox-shadow: var(--shadow-product);     /* product shots */'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Depth is quiet. In light mode, tiles rest on soft shadows and lift on hover; in dark mode, a faint top highlight replaces the shadow.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="tile elev elev-flat"><code>flat</code></div>
        <div class="tile elev elev-rest"><code>--shadow-tile</code></div>
        <div class="tile elev elev-hover"><code>--shadow-tile-hover</code></div>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Borders" code={'border: 1px solid var(--border);         /* hairlines, outlines */\nborder: 1px solid var(--border-strong);  /* secondary buttons, inputs */'}>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="border-sample border-soft"><code>--border</code></div>
        <div class="border-sample border-strong"><code>--border-strong</code></div>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<style>
    .radii {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .radius {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 7rem;
        height: 7rem;
        background: var(--bg-alt);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }

    .r-sm { border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
    .r-md { border-radius: var(--radius); }
    .r-lg { border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
    .r-xl { border-radius: var(--radius-xl); }
    .r-pill { width: 10rem; height: 3rem; border-radius: 999px; }

    .squircle-compare {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .squircle-compare figure {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        justify-items: center;
    }

    .squircle-compare figcaption {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }

    .sq-sample {
        width: 10rem;
        height: 10rem;
        border-radius: 2.5rem;
        background: var(--brand-gradient);
    }

    .sq-round {
        corner-shape: round;
    }

    .elev {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        height: 9rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }

    .elev-rest { box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile); }
    .elev-hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile-hover); }

    .border-sample {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        height: 6rem;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }

    .border-soft { border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .border-strong { border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }
</style>
